# Melee: let a zombie come close, slap it with V, and check that the points grow.
expect hud.points 0
until zombies.alive 4 300
wait 420
aim
shot 01-before
tap melee
wait 5
shot 02-mid-swing
wait 40
aim
tap melee
wait 5
shot 03-second-swing
wait 40
aim
tap melee
wait 40
state 04-after
shot 04-after
expect_not hud.points 0
